  PromptDialogue: "I\u2019m not sure if your \u201Cgovernment\u201D sponsored school
    taught you that plants actually need CO2 to grow, so how come having more is
    bad?? You\u2019re saying we should starve our plants?"
  correctCardName: CO2Overdose
  correctCardSelected: "Huh\u2026 I never thought about it like that. I guess even
    good things can have a limit. If too much CO2 messes with the climate and hurts
    crops, that\u2019s definitely not helping plants after all."
  incorrectCardSelected: "That doesn't make sense at all. You clearly don\u2019t
    understand how all of this really works."
